<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 2.82 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 2.82 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Thursday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 2.82 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Jan 27			2,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Jan		6,319</p>
<p> Average reserves to Jan 22			   8,039</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    2,820</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358-9-680 50 240</p>
